<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $0.50 lower  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $0.50 lower  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower than Friday's close. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   230-260 lbs    58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   260-270 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows 1.00 to 3.00 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs    41.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  over 500 lbs    45.00-48.00</p>
</text>
